  "description": "# SIP2.X: Add 1 Ark to LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 1 new Ark to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional an Ark will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- Number of Ark to add: 1\n\n## New Ark Address\n1. `0x7B1e86949C7B74761046d79Fb457985FB3a494F3`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for the Ark\n2. Add the Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-36-expedited-upgrade-of-legacy-fluid-arks-to-enable-reward-harvesting/428\n",
